WEBVTT

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.200
You bastard!

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.110
General Tabira!

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.440
I got it, gi.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.940
These guys were wimps, gi.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.150
I'll be leaving, gi!

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.570
Go ahead.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.370
I can't use that drug.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.910
You take care of the rest, gi.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:43.200
I didn't expect Rapture to get here so soon.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:45.970
She's alive!

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:47.250
She's alive, chu!

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:29.000
<b>The Magical Girls and This Beautiful World</b>

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.000
<b>Patong Beach, Thailand
2 Hours Time Difference With Japan</b>

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.330
Yeah, right there!

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.520
Harder...

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.910
That's amazing.

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:03.830
They got bigger again, I think.

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:12.170
I didn't think the Babel Brigade would
be doing operations at that scale.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.840
I hope they leave me out of it, nya!

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.300
<i>I need to go help Asuka-san!</i>

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.620
<i>If I can inject her with this...</i>

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.340
This actually isn't a whip.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.110
My Magical Bandage

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:48.350
protects my fists and 
enhances my striking power.

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:49.310
Karate?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.460
<i>My code-name is Whiplash.</i>

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.130
<i>And it's not because I use a whip,</i>

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:03.130
<i>but because my kicks lash out like one.</i>

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:07.210
<i>My magical power is
greater than hers, but...</i>

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:11.100
This is my karate.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:14.580
Your defenses won't protect you from me.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.390
I won't let you attack me any more.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:19.860
I'll just keep kicking you,
and you can't stop me.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:24.090
You're going to be my sandbag.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.670
I'm...

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.140
your sandbag?

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.200
Hey, Kurumi...

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:37.980
Be our sandbag!

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.060
Hey, Kurumi...

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:41.090
Be our ATM!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:43.660
Be our air gun target!

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.650
Be our garbage can!

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.780
Let us experiment
on you for science class!

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:46.700
Be our mop!

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:53.290
You're our leftover-eating machine, you know.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.310
You're one of them.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.920
You're one of them...

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:06.910
You're going to treat me like
a thing too, aren't you?

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.080
I'll kill you!

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:15.400
<i>That armor's as tough as it looks.</i>

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:18.600
<i>I'll strike the joints!</i>

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:22.020
<i>He deflected the blade!</i>

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:27.490
I'm an anti-Magical Girl weapon.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:31.190
Did you think I'd come without
any defenses against Rapture's claws?

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:41.770
<i>Does he just have a 
bottomless bag of tricks?</i>

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:59.280
<i>I don't know if I can kill her...</i>

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.830
<i>She might kill me!</i>

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:04.040
<i>In the three years since
I lost Asuka-san,</i>

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.440
<i>I haven't just been wasting my time.</i>

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:08.700
<i>The JSDF's new martial arts,</i>

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.220
<i>Brazilian jiu jitsu...</i>

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:12.990
<i>I've been learning, too!</i>

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.700
<i>If I can get her in pinned...</i>

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:22.960
Fool.

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:31.930
Throws and locks are a part
of the karate kata, too.

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.850
So are tackle counters.

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:37.570
As long as you've properly analyzed
and trained the karate kata,

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:39.300
you can deal with them.

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:44.670
Now I'm going to beat you to death.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:55.460
<i>Am I always going to be like this?</i>

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:57.600
<i>They said I was part of the Magical Five,</i>

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:01.450
<i>but whenever somebody tough shows up,
 this is what happens.</i>

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:05.970
<i>She's punched me so much,
I feel like I'm about to throw up!</i>

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.420
You're our slave forever!

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:10.860
Bitch!

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:12.760
<i>No!</i>

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:17.110
<i>I'm not going back to who I was!</i>

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:18.760
<i>I'm...</i>

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:22.760
I'm...

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:26.400
Magical Girl War Nurse Kurumi!

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:41.710
Now I can go help Asuka-san.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:45.150
Chu!

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.700
Roll, roll, roll, roll!

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:50.520
H-He's so cool!

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.140
<i>Does he just have a 
bottomless bag of tricks?</i>

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:04.670
So the enemy's prepared for Rapture's attacks?

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.260
Understood.

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:09.730
I'll receive it directly.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.660
Iizuka-san, what is it?

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:18.280
The special equipment I asked
permission to use has just arrived.

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:22.350
I'll receive it directly and hand
it to the Magical Girls.

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:26.660
Is it so important that
you have to go yourself?

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:27.600
Yes.

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:29.320
And...

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:32.610
Even if they're Magical Girls...

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.090
Relying entirely on children like that

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:40.430
is a little embarrassing
for the Special Forces Group.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:11.640
Chu...

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:17.920
Asuka?

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:20.260
Now...

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.520
I wonder if Chisato's okay.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.600
Asuka!

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:35.670
<i>Sacchuu,</i>

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:36.770
<i>don't freak out.</i>

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:37.960
Chu!

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:45.130
<i>I can sense a special liquid magic
flowing through the surface of the armor.</i>

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:47.880
<i>Which means if we can sever the...</i>

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:52.820
<i>There should be a liquid magic tank
somewhere on that thing's body.</i>

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.760
<i>Can you find it?</i>

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:55.970
Sacchuu!

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:58.470
You're tough.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.790
That explains how you became
the Magical Girl who saved the world.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:08.440
When I was still a normal child...

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:14.410
I saw on the news that Magical Girls were
fighting enemies from another world.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.720
And it made me happy.

00:10:17.310 --> 00:10:19.810
I thought the world would change.

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:24.580
That the Magical Girls might save us, too.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.280
But I was wrong.

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:30.630
The Magical Girls defeated the monsters,

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.460
but the world...

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.700
Humanity...

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:36.190
They hate each other,

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.330
kill each other...

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:41.530
Maybe the world would be better off destroyed!

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.870
I know what you mean.

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:48.490
The Magical Girls...

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:49.960
The power of miracles...

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.140
The saviors...

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:55.350
I know that's not what we are
better than anybody else.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:11:00.970
And sometimes I've wondered whether
this world is even worth protecting.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.830
More than once or twice.

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.070
But still...

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.740
No matter how many problems there are...

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:11.760
There are beautiful things in the world!

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:15.150
Things worth protecting!

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:20.940
Things worth fighting for!

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:26.960
I'm happy I got to talk to you.

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:29.160
This is the end!

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:30.860
Analysis complete!

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:33.120
The liquid magic tank is on his backside,
 near his hips!

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:34.230
The left side!

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:35.170
Okay!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.700
Magic Calorie Roll-Up!

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:39.440
Rip them apart,

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:40.890
Rapture Talon!

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.620
You got it!

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.290
That surprised me!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:51.940
But your weapon is still
embedded in my side.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.820
What will you do now, bare-handed,

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.390
and with only one arm?!

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:01.810
You have to know that
pea-shooter won't work on me.

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:03.340
Those aren't even magical bullets.

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:05.160
Did you come to die?!

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.970
Asuka, take this!

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:10.230
Magical Blacksmith's Ilmarinen's Topor!

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:36.940
Almost there...

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.490
We're almost to the safe zone.

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:41.860
Or at least, we were supposed to be.

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:52.990
Get down.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.260
Magic Calorie Roll-Up!

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:57.290
Burn them all!

00:12:57.690 --> 00:12:59.840
Phoenix Razgromit Luč!

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:13.980
You're late.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.740
What's going on at the base?

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:20.710
Do you think I, of all people, would leave
my post before the job was done?

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:26.450
Every time I see you,
you're covered in blood,

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.160
Texas Girl.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.790
Shut up, Russian.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.370
Have some vodka and shut your fucking mouth.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:34.780
I'm still a minor.

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:37.250
That was a joke, moron.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.550
Who are those two?

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:41.010
The girls who saved my life.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:58.330
I guess it's over for me too, huh?

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:05.770
You have such sad eyes. It's hard
to believe you're a young girl.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:09.850
They're like the eyes
of a wolf freezing in the cold.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:14.660
The general is alive.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.280
You've lost.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:19.260
You have no idea.

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:23.250
We were after the magic item, not her.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.590
With that,

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:31.810
the Babel Brigade's plan
can move into its final stages.

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:34.250
Asuka-san!

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:39.930
Your arm!

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:41.500
I got it!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.270
Put it back on!

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:45.160
Asuka-san, give me your arm!

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:52.140
That's who you really are, huh?

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:54.460
Chisato...

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.330
I'm sorry.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.350
I lost.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:02.290
It's fine.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.920
You don't need to apologize.

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:06.770
But I do.

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:09.170
I'm going to die soon.

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:11.180
And before I do,

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.260
there's something I need to tell you.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:17.150
The accident where your mother died...

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:21.230
We were responsible for that.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:24.780
A year ago...

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:27.360
When we were scouting the Naha Base.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:31.190
Killgee happened to see a girl
with powerful magical ability.

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:34.680
We thought that if we put her
under severe mental stress,

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:37.130
she might join us.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:42.870
And so we used remote control magic
to take over the steering wheel of the car

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:45.150
those kids were driving.

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:52.350
So you wanted to make
me a Magical Girl the whole time?

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:54.840
I'm really... sorry.

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.920
But...

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:59.390
You became a Magical Girl.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.530
When it's all over,

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:04.320
a new world will be open to you.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:06.860
Forget us.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.270
And no matter what you have to do...

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:12.030
Be happy.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.720
Giess...

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:33.430
She's so sad, she went insane.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:42.270
She really does look sad.

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.320
I got word from the surface.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:01.610
Mia and Tamara are safe!

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:05.480
I'm so glad.

00:17:14.120 --> 00:17:15.220
How's your arm?

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.130
It still feels weird,

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.080
but my fingers move now.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:20.680
Good.

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:36.540
So you wiped out the enemies
that entered the building, huh?

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.990
I knew the two of you would be okay.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.230
You come too, Kurumi.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.420
Let's all have a big hug.

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:53.000
Okay!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.800
<b>Squeeze</b>

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:00.300
It's so moving, bi!

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:03.070
It's an animal I don't recognize!

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:05.560
I'm not an animal, I'm Tabira, bi!

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.310
She turned into a fairy
to help recover her strength, chu!

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:10.360
Bi?

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:12.490
<i>Cute!</i>

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:15.230
Let me join you too, bi!

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:16.650
Bi!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.120
Bi, bi...

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.290
How did you enjoy
your first fight, rookie?

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.670
I was wrong.

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:43.200
The Magical Girls are pieces of shit,

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:46.420
but I'm done picking and
choosing who fights on my side.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:47.970
You think they're pieces of shit?

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:49.250
I sure do.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:52.940
What kind of pile of shit
makes teenage girls fight?

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:56.440
That I'm never changing my mind about.

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:09.190
We made a lot of mistakes
we can learn from,

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:11.630
but on the whole,
it's safe to say we did well.

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:13.650
But...

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:17.470
Our mission isn't over.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:19.370
Until the gate is repaired,

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:24.140
and General Tabira is back safely
in the Spirit World, we're not done here!

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:25.180
Dismissed!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:26.100
Yes, sir!

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:28.310
Thanks for your help, bi!

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.860
This is General Tabira.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:36.990
<i>General</i> Tabira.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:39.860
This is how I'll look like for a while, bi.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:44.950
It's only thanks to your valiant
efforts that I'm still alive, bi!

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:53.850
We made it through.

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:55.810
We haven't taken that kind
of damage since the great war.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:58.070
But we were able to avoid
the worst case scenario.

00:19:58.070 --> 00:20:00.270
First, we need to work
on a reconstruction plan,

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.030
then figure out what we'll
 do for the victims' families.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.210
I'm counting on you.

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:09.140
We can't let it end like this.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:20.310
Killgee!

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:22.270
It worked, gi!

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:23.720
And Giess?

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:25.700
Probably dead, gi.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:26.650
Oh.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.240
How sad.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:36.790
This item doesn't belong
with the Legendary Five.

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:41.230
It belongs to another, special girl.

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:48.090
We come all the way to Okinawa
and then that happens.

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:51.530
Are we the most unlucky teenage girls in Japan?

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:54.420
I think we're lucky, actually.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:55.720
We're still alive.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.810
It's thanks to you.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.440
Thank you.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.700
This is goodbye, huh?

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:17.160
We'll see each other soon somewhere.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:20.270
Unfortunately, you're probably right.

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:22.430
Someday...

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:24.710
If we could meet off the battlefield...

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.270
Yeah.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:32.200
That's right.

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:37.750
I-I'll go anywhere as long
as I can be with Asuka-san.

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:41.720
B-But you're right!

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:43.530
I think that would be good.

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:46.320
Then let's pray that day comes.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:47.060
Yeah.

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:56.080
This wasn't a bad reunion.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.600
Yeah.

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:59.780
I was happy I got to see your faces.

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:02.340
Let's meet again.

00:22:05.150 --> 00:22:06.320
Yeah, see you around!

00:23:57.600 --> 00:24:00.960
Kurumi's got this torture
thing down pat, doesn't she, chu?

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:02.690
Anyway, time for the last episode!

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:05.410
What will happen with
the last of the Magical Five?

00:24:05.410 --> 00:24:06.170
Next time...

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:09.210
<b>If This Battle Ever Ends</b>

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.530
"If This Battle Ever Ends."

00:24:08.530 --> 00:24:11.610
Asuka, where will you go now, chu?
